# Vanta G1b: --vanta-config=<path> --vanta-pubkey=<base64 Ed25519 key>.
# Ed25519 (BoringSSL) over the payload bytes exactly as vanta-fingerprint
# config.rs signs them; bad/missing signature -> exit 86; persona engine
# version != this engine's version_info -> exit 87. Browser process only,
# checked in ChromeMainDelegate::BasicStartupComplete.

